## Third-party identity provider packages

| Role | Import path | Filesystem path |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| **Abstraction** | `github.com/usememos/memos/internal/idp` | `/bench/repo/internal/idp/` |
| **Concrete protocol (OAuth2)** | `github.com/usememos/memos/internal/idp/oauth2` | `/bench/repo/internal/idp/oauth2/` |

Only one protocol implementation ships: **OAuth2**. Proto enums list `OAUTH2 = 1` as the sole non-unspecified type; there is no SAML/OIDC/LDAP subpackage under `internal/idp/`.

---

